OL,3,A'Ashamed': Cornell students gather to
OL,4,Avoice anger over alleged gang rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents have called for drastic change
OL,7,Fat Cornell University as a result of an
OL,8,Falleged gang rape in 2024, with one
OL,9,Fusing an emotional student assembly on
OL,10,FThursday to say: "We're absolutely
OL,11,Fashamed of the events that happened on
OL,12,Fcampus."
OL,14,FStudents and faculty members say the
OL,15,Finvestigation into the incident has
OL,16,Fcast a "dark cloud" over the campus -
OL,17,Fstirring anger, concern over fraternity
OL,18,Fculture, and a backlash against the
OL,19,Funiversity's handling of the situation.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
